	(text "⚠ XNANO MODIFICATION REQUIRED:\n  Cut R100 (0Ω strap inside XNANO) to isolate VTG from USB-5V.\n  After cut, J1.1 (VTG) is fed by VIN_5V from J2 bench supply.\n  mEDBG stays on USB-5V (separate domain) — debug works during low-V cutout test."
